//! replayCut's fresh residual and mixing-weight copies, tailRowsCopy's ring restores and the position upload run as
//! tf_ds_resume_assemble_kernel: each output row takes both fields from the tail ring's slot (replay + i) % window
//! (i < pre, the restored prefix) or from fresh row first + i - pre, and writes its position on device. Pure: no cuda
